// Equipment ([CR#205.3g], [CR#301.5]) — an artifact subtype that can be
// attached only to a creature. Under default-deny attachment, being attachable
// to a creature is a GRANT the subtype confers: `May(Attach(to: Creature))`.
// The grant is a rule of the SUBTYPE, not a removable card ability, so it is
// conferred `Innate`: it survives "loses all abilities" while
// `attachment_legal` reads the `May(Attach)` generically (no engine subtype
// branch). The equip ACTIVATED ability rides the Equip keyword, not the
// subtype.
//
// Authored directly as a `Subtype` (not via the `ArtifactType` meta-macro)
// because this artifact subtype carries a `confers:` list.
(
    name: "Equipment",
    kinds: [Subtype],
    body: Subtype(
        name: "Equipment",
        types: [Artifact],
        confers: [
            Ability(Innate(Static(May(Attach(what: Ref(This), to: Type("Creature")))))),
        ],
    ),
)
